        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, right margin",
          "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">My uncle asked me to write you and ask you about what Q\u0101sim had bought for him and at what price, and of the flax, whose it was. I also would like you to let me know if he bought anything for me, and of the flax he bought for me, and the price. If you bought let me know how the growers sold and how sold M\u016bs\u0101llam</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
