      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto, top margin",
          "value": "<p>(I)bn (A)b\u016b Kitama. You wrote about the situation of the dinars. I looked it up in the ledger and found that he debited you with 12 dinars less 2 \u00bd qirats (5/48ths dinar). I told him of the situation regarding the 2\u215b dinars less 1 habba (habba= 1/72nd, thus 2 1/9) [ ] he will pay them to you.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
